{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918072bcdf2a25e723a49da5075a531a493366bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 90^\\circ$\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a649aee592a9c37d2f9b5d5239f5e06e533130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd4a05effdcd1ddc8b41af4f6f0bfe820ed4d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. On the side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, there are two points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> such the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is a square, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the circle through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with centre <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. If the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a964dc4456ed42fcc8c54c7d4054fd8c79ceb890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p>ത്രികോണം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />-ൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918072bcdf2a25e723a49da5075a531a493366bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 90^\\circ$\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a649aee592a9c37d2f9b5d5239f5e06e533130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd4a05effdcd1ddc8b41af4f6f0bfe820ed4d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />-യുടെ വശത്ത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നീ രണ്ട് ബിന്ദുക്കൾ ഉണ്ട്, അങ്ങനെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />-ക്കും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />-ക്കും ഇടയിൽ കിടക്കുകയും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> ഒരു ചതുരമായിരിക്കുകയും ചെയ്യുന്നു, ഇവിടെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />-ൽ കിടക്കുകയും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, കേന്ദ്രം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> ആയുള്ള <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />-യിലൂടെ കടന്നുപോകുന്ന വൃത്തത്തിൽ കിടക്കുകയും ചെയ്യുന്നു. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />-യുടെ വിസ്തീർണ്ണം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" /> എന്ന രൂപത്തിലാണെങ്കിൽ, ഇവിടെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> എന്നിവ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a7986370c73f39e8e4cc79eaa379bac4e14eec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(m,n) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" /> ആയ പോസിറ്റീവ് പൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യകളാണ്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />-ന്റെ മൂല്യം എന്താണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Ioqm_p_15_2025.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/41/Ioqm_p_15_2025.png/450px-Ioqm_p_15_2025.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"523\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/41/Ioqm_p_15_2025.png/675px-Ioqm_p_15_2025.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/4/41/Ioqm_p_15_2025.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>First, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd1ca98e626c085660123908b1f8895269cfe68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/1/7e1231ea1b2a73ac0450355f2f7abe77d9fa1677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00ca3584a84cec4b736a483baa9690589953aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb88fe38efcc286f6d310ff438b68b9316cbd45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y= 2-2s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />. Now, assume the side length of the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620ba1f98e0eeaece509347c5eac642a6db8103c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(0,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e88a424cb9e3ccb66ce14f75476cf51ca7bd324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E(0,y+s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d1aa47584c70d5ef1754a82a9ff01c99d7d682b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(s,y+s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891ed999625a4cd250a23d5bcd97f297658264ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G(s,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a8f04a623e891e915d72e5c59962c2e881e7bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+s = 2-2s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b30c1f92bc4d862e6faf7e42c9a7c8d7b5f12875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2-3s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd8b4122e36bc097b226cac5343f981f7d50f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega: (x-1)^2 + y^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd57901e7baba503ad6ffcaa6637ce6caad6243d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(s-1)^2 + y^2 = 1 \\implies (s-1)^2 + (2-3s)^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"21\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce2860b5db201a3794eb8f3806a3e7c7883eed0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\frac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />, and the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7348cac7e6a81babe432f29c2d42508ee3c59305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{25} \\implies \\boxed{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>ആദ്യം, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd1ca98e626c085660123908b1f8895269cfe68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> എന്ന് എടുക്കുക, അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/1/7e1231ea1b2a73ac0450355f2f7abe77d9fa1677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00ca3584a84cec4b736a483baa9690589953aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> എന്നിവയാണ്. തുടർന്ന്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />-ന് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb88fe38efcc286f6d310ff438b68b9316cbd45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y= 2-2s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> എന്ന സമവാക്യം ലഭിക്കുന്നു. ഇനി, ചതുരത്തിന്റെ വശനീളം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> ആണെന്ന് കരുതുക. അപ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620ba1f98e0eeaece509347c5eac642a6db8103c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(0,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e88a424cb9e3ccb66ce14f75476cf51ca7bd324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E(0,y+s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d1aa47584c70d5ef1754a82a9ff01c99d7d682b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(s,y+s)$\